  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dali Private Label Supplier Network Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will finance the expansion of Dali&apos;s network of hard discount retail stores and distribution centers, and procurement from local private label suppliers.  In addition, the project will fund off-grid rooftop solar panels and green building certifications for some stores and distribution centers to support energy cost savings and reduce the carbon footprint of Dali&apos;s operations.</narrative>
  </description>
